Here's the problem file for slicing a tomato based on the given domain and objects:

```pddl
(define (problem slice_tomato_problem)
  (:domain robot1)
  (:objects
    robot1 - robot
    Knife - object
    Tomato - object
    CounterTop - object
    CuttingBoard - object
  )
  (:init
    (not (inaction robot1))
    (at robot1 CounterTop)
    (at-location Knife CounterTop)
    (at-location Tomato CounterTop)
  )
  (:goal
    (and
      (sliced Tomato)
    )
  )
)
```

Problem file generation is done.